MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

One object = one index entry = one coherence record. The entry holds the object's
LNR location (cn_array_[0], flag bit 62 | offset/64 from the replica flush base)
and its size (cn_array_[1], invalidate_ set so it never counts as a local copy).
IdxGetter::obj_span lets exec_notify flush [base, base+size) where it flushes a
slot; slots keep upstream's range. New FFI ObjectCreate (CheckPut, no new log op,
entry size stays 128 B) and object replay flush counters. Tests: object_tests.rs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
